is given by:
\begin{equation}
g_{\mu\nu} = g^{(0)}_{\mu\nu}
+ A\,\partial_\mu \partial_\nu \rho_I
+ B\,(\partial_\mu \rho_I)(\partial_\nu \rho_I),
\end{equation}
where $A$ and $B$ are determined by the UV-regularized quadratic gravity 
coefficients $(\xi, \lambda)$.